            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Improved</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Better video capture in the embedded browser.</li>
  <li>New feeds check their address automatically.</li>
  <li>Tracker lists show line numbers.</li>
  <li>Clearer wording throughout the app.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Fixed</h2>
<ul>
  <li>The Files tab stays responsive for torrents with many files.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
